The first mounted-view metadata fix still shared one mutable OAuth provider, so /authorize was bound to the last configured view resource (/view/coding-agent/mcp). Use independent auth providers and path-aware OAuth metadata per mounted view so /view/remote/authorize accepts resource /view/remote/mcp.
